    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toddobaatan Sannadood Oo Maxbuusnimo Ah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa eraygii Yeremyaah u yimid oo ku saabsanaa dadka Yahuudah oo dhan, waxayna ahayd Yehooyaaqiim ina Yoosiyaah oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah sannaddiisii afraad, taasoo ahayd sannaddii kowaad oo Nebukadresar oo ahaa boqorkii Baabuloon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eraygaas Nebi Yeremyaah ayaa kula hadlay dadkii Yahuudah oo dhan iyo kuwii Yeruusaalem degganaa oo dhan, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tan iyo sannaddii saddex iyo tobnaad oo Yoosiyaah ina Aamoon uu boqor ka ahaa dalka Yahuudah iyo ilaa maantadan la joogo, taasoo ah saddex iyo labaatan sannadood, waxaa ii imanayay Eraygii Rabbiga, oo aniguna waan idinla hadlay, anoo goor wanaagsan idinla hadlaya, laakiinse idinku innaba ma aydaan dhegaysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiguna wuxuu idiin soo diray addoommadiisii nebiyada ahaa oo dhan, isagoo goor wanaagsan diraya, laakiinse idinku innaba ma aydaan dhegaysan, oo marnaba dheg uma aydaan dhigin inaad maqashaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay yidhaahdeen, Midkiin kastaaba haatan jidkiisa ha ka soo noqdo, oo sharka falimihiinnana ka noqda, oo waxaad iska dhex degganaataan dalkii Rabbigu idinka iyo awowayaashiinba weligiin iyo weligiinba idin siiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ilaahyo kale ha u daba gelina inaad u adeegtaan oo caabuddaan, oo shuqullada gacmihiinna ha igaga cadhaysiinina, oo aniguna innaba wax idin yeeli maayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse ima aydaan dhegaysan, ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay, si aad shuqullada gacmihiinna igaga cadhaysiisaan, oo ay waxyeello idiin soo gaadho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Erayadaydii waad dhegaysan weydeen, oo sidaas daraaddeed, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal ogaada, waxaan soo diri doonaa qolooyinka reer woqooyi oo dhan, iyo addoonkayga ah Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo iyagaan ku soo kicin doonaa dalkan, iyo dadka deggan, iyo quruumaha ku wareegsan oo dhan, oo kulligoodna waan wada baabbi'in doonaa, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa wax laga yaabo oo loogu foodhyo, iyo cidla weligeed ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaan iyaga ka baabbi'in doonaa codka rayraynta, iyo codka farxadda, iyo codka arooska, iyo codka aroosadda, iyo sanqadha dhagaxshiidka, iyo iftiinka laambadda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalkan oo dhammuna wuxuu noqon doonaa cidla iyo wax laga yaabo, oo quruumahanuna toddobaatan sannadood ayay boqorka Baabuloon u adeegi doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay toddobaatanka sannadood dhammaadaan ayaan xumaantooda aawadeed u ciqaabi doonaa boqorka Baabuloon iyo quruuntaas, iyo dalka reer Kaldayiinba, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa meelo weligoodba cidla ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan dalkaas ku soo dayn doonaa erayadaydii aan kaga hadlay oo dhan, kuwaasoo ah waxa kitaabkan ku qoran oo dhan, oo ah wixii Yeremyaah quruumaha oo dhan ka sii sheegay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, iyagaba waxaa addoonsan doona quruumo badan iyo boqorro waaweyn, oo waxaan iyaga u abaal marin doonaa siday falimahoodu ahaayeen, iyo siday shuqullada gacmahoodu ahaayeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koobkii Cadhada Ilaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu igu leeyahay, Cadhadan koobkeeda khamriga gacantayda ka qaad, oo waxaad wada cabsiisaa quruumaha aan kuu dirayo oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana way cabbi doonaan, oo way iska dhacdhici doonaan, wayna la waalan doonaan seefta aan dhexdooda u soo dirayo daraaddeed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaan koobkii gacantii Rabbiga ka qaaday, oo waxaan cabsiiyey quruumihii Rabbigu ii diray oo dhan, kuwaas oo ahaa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeruusaalem, iyo magaalooyinka dalka Yahuudah, iyo boqorradooda, iyo amiirradooda, si aan iyaga uga dhigo cidla, iyo wax laga yaabo oo lagu foodhyo, iyo inkaar, siday maantaba tahay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Fircoon oo ah boqorka Masar, iyo addoommadiisa, iyo amiirradiisa, iyo dadkiisa oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo dadka isku qasan oo dhan, iyo boqorrada dalka Cuus oo dhan, iyo boqorrada dalka reer Falastiin oo dhan, iyo Ashqeloon, iyo Gaasa, iyo Ceqroon, iyo kuwa Ashdood ka hadhay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Edom, iyo Moo'aab, iyo reer Cammoon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqorrada Turos oo dhan, iyo boqorrada Siidoon oo dhan, iyo boqorrada gasiiradaha badda ka shisheeya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Dedaan, iyo Teemaa, iyo Buus, iyo inta timaha dhinacyada ka jarata oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqorrada Carabiya oo dhan, iyo boqorrada dadka isku qasan oo lamadegaanka dhex deggan oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqorrada Simrii oo dhan, iyo boqorrada Ceelaam oo dhan, iyo boqorrada reer Maaday oo dhan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqorrada woqooyi oo dhan, ku fog iyo ku dhowba, kan iyo kaasba, iyo boqortooyooyinka dunida ee dhulka joogo oo dhan, oo iyaga dabadoodna waxaa cabbi doona boqorka Sheeshag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu idinku leeyahay, Cabba oo sakhraama, oo mantaga, oo dhaca, oo innaba mar dambe ha soo sara kicina, seefta aan dhexdiinna u soo diri doono daraaddeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hadday diidaan inay koobka gacantaada ka qaataan oo ay cabbaan, markaas waxaad iyaga ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu idinku leeyahay, Hubaal waad cabbi doontaan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal eega, waxaan bilaabayaa inaan masiibo ku soo dejiyo magaaladii laygu magacaabay, haddaba miyaan idinkana laydin wada ciqaabayn? Idinku ciqaabla'aan ku sii joogi maysaan, waayo, waxaan u yeedhayaa seef inay ku dhacdo dadka dhulka deggan oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed erayadan oo dhan iyaga kaga sii hadal, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Rabbigu xagga saruu ka qaylin doonaa, oo codkiisuu kaga soo hadli doonaa hoygiisa quduuska ah, oo wuxuu si weyn ugu qaylin doonaa xeradiisa, oo dadka dhulka deggan oo dhanna wuxuu ugu qaylin doonaa sida kuwa canabka ku tunta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Dhawaaq baa gaadhi doona tan iyo dhulka darafkiisa, maxaa yeelay, Rabbigu dacwad buu la leeyahay quruumaha, oo wuxuu la muddacayaa binu-aadmiga oo dhan, oo kuwa sharka ahna seef buu u gacangelin doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, masiibaa soo bixi doonta oo quruun bay quruun kale uga sii gudbi doontaa, oo duufaan weyn ayaa laga soo kicin doonaa dhulka darafyadiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa Rabbigu laaya waxay maalintaas oolli doonaan dhulka darafkiisan iyo darafkiisa kale inta ka dhex leh. Oo iyaga looma barooran doono, lamana soo ururin doono, lamana xabaali doono, oo waxay noqon doonaan sida digo dhulka ku kor daadsan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adhijirradow, ooya oo qayliya; kuwa adhiga madaxda u ahow, dambas ku galgasha, waayo, wakhtigii laydin gowraci lahaa waa yimid. Waan idin burburin doonaa, oo waxaad u dhici doontaan sida weel wanaagsan oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo adhijirradu meel ay ku cararaan ma ay heli doonaan, oo adhiga madaxdiisuna meel ay ku baxsadaan ma ay heli doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa la maqli doonaa codkii qaylada adhijirrada, iyo cidii adhiga madaxdiisa, waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu kala baabbi'iyey daaqsintoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xeryihii nabaadiinada waa la wada baabbi'iyey Rabbiga xanaaqiisa kulul aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuxuu meeshiisii qarsoonayd uga soo baxay sidii libaax oo kale, waayo, dalkoodii cidla buu noqday, waana baabbi'iyaha cadhadiisa aawadeed iyo xanaaqiisa kulul aawadiis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
